{
 "_comment": "YouQwiz English (09/11/2026), phase 1: universal banks only (flags, countries, animals, fruits, alphabet, maths, emoji puzzles, odd one out, would you rather, acronyms). Long video 6 PM New York time, Shorts at 12 PM and 7 PM ET. No Saturday site special (the site is French-only). Same mechanics as data/rotation.json.",
